      "Language": "eng",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "This paper describes two patients with vertically cracked roots. They illustrate the detailed attention which should be given to the signs, symptoms, and subsequent investigations which may lead to a diagnosis of vertical root fracture, and show the advantages of consultation between the periodontist, the endodontist, and the general dental practitioner."},
